        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/ed8c4c/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2018-12-04T04:16:26.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Ok I understand these are questions that have probably been answered a couple times, but I'm struggling to find them.</p>\n<p>1. If damage is dealt to a hero target and redirected to another hero target how does dmg reduction work.</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; Ex. If legacy is hit for 3 dmg and he has on fortitude (reduce dmg to him by 1), but the dmg is then redirected to Unity's stealth bot (which reduces dmg dealt to it by 1) would stealth bot take 1 dmg (reduced by both effects) or 2 dmg (reduced by only stealth bot)</p>\n<p>2. If dmg is dealt to multiple targets or all targets say via Ra's Scorched earth, how is dmg dealt?</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;A) all targets at once. B) each target individually based off how long they have been there. C) each target individually with players choosing dmg order. D) some other method.</p>\n<p>Thank you to anyone who can answer these for me.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:52:15.208Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
